# Optional. Base URL of the Chiron FastAPI server (no trailing slash).
# Leave unset for local dev to use the Vite dev server proxy (same-origin /api and /ws).
# VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Production (e.g. Vercel): set VITE_BACKEND_URL in the project env to your deployed API
# origin (https://your-api.example.com). Vercel only serves the static web app; the API must
# run elsewhere (Railway, Fly, Render, etc.).
